{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-02-01 23:51:09 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-CouncilSessions] [Project: query_enhancement_suite] Council_MCP session system analyzed - database-backed sessions with rich metadata tracking. Key schema: god_sessions table with id (UUID), god_slug (agent identifier), session_type, mode_started/ended, invoker, workspace, metadata JSONB, started_at/ended_at timestamps. Sessions link to project_id, support summary text, and connect to audit entries + memories. | confidence=0.95; files_analyzed=[\"council_mcp/mcp/tools/sessions.py\", \"council_mcp/storage/models.py\"]; key_fields=[\"id\", \"god_slug\", \"session_type\", \"workspace\", \"metadata\", \"started_at\", \"ended_at\", \"project_id\"]; reasoning={\"how\": \"Read sessions.py tool layer and models.py storage layer, traced session creation flow, identified table schema and query patterns\", \"what\": \"god_sessions table structure, session lifecycle operations (open/close/query), agent mapping via god_slug, relationship to memories and audit entries\", \"why\": \"Need to understand Council's session schema and lifecycle to compare with Scribe's agent_sessions implementation\"}; schema_discovered=god_sessions; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/query_enhancement_suite/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-01T23:51:09.799355+00:00_fdfd76cb", "timestamp": "2026-02-01T23:51:09.799420+00:00"}
