{"op": "append", "content": "[\u26a0\ufe0f] [2026-02-01 23:51:25 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-QueryTools] [Project: query_enhancement_suite] CRITICAL FINDING: Storage backend query_entries signature requires ProjectRecord as first param - agents filter is PROJECT-SCOPED ONLY. Line 613-614 shows \"project_id = ?\" clause, lines 623-626 show agents IN filter is scoped to that project. Cross-project agent filtering requires significant storage layer changes. | confidence=1; constraint=ProjectRecord required param enforces single-project queries; finding=agents_filter_project_scoped; reasoning={\"how\": \"Read base.py abstract signature and sqlite.py implementation, traced SQL WHERE clauses\", \"what\": \"Storage backend API contract - ProjectRecord required, WHERE project_id clause enforced\", \"why\": \"Need to understand current scope limitations before proposing cross-project enhancements\"}; storage_files=[\"base.py:184-220\", \"sqlite.py:594-750\"]; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/query_enhancement_suite/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-01T23:51:25.840707+00:00_5ea1089c", "timestamp": "2026-02-01T23:51:25.840769+00:00"}
