{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-02-01 23:51:37 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-CouncilSessions] [Project: query_enhancement_suite] Scribe session system analyzed - TWO tables: (1) scribe_sessions (session_id, transport_session_id, agent_id, repo_root, mode, started_at, last_active_at), (2) session_projects (session_id, project_name, updated_at). Sessions track agent and repo context but lack rich metadata. No direct session-to-entries FK relationship discovered yet. Session_id computation happens at server.py transport layer. | confidence=0.9; files_analyzed=[\"storage/sqlite.py\"]; key_limitation=no_session_fk_on_entries; reasoning={\"how\": \"Traced upsert_session, get_session_mode, set_session_project methods, reviewed schema definitions, identified lack of session_id column on scribe_logs\", \"what\": \"Session tables structure, session-to-project mapping, agent tracking, session lifecycle operations, relationship to log entries\", \"why\": \"Need to understand Scribe's session storage to compare with Council and identify gaps for query enhancement\"}; tables_discovered=[\"scribe_sessions\", \"session_projects\"]; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/query_enhancement_suite/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-01T23:51:37.059076+00:00_aee8cbd3", "timestamp": "2026-02-01T23:51:37.059133+00:00"}
