{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-02-01 23:51:50 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-BugWorkflow] [Project: query_enhancement_suite] Analyzed bug template - found 25+ template fields but open_bug only populates 13, leaving 12+ as placeholders | confidence=0.95; file=templates/documents/BUG_REPORT_TEMPLATE.md; findings={\"populated_by_open_bug\": 13, \"total_template_fields\": 25, \"unpopulated_fields\": [\"component\", \"environment\", \"customer_impact\", \"expected_behavior\", \"reproduction_steps\", \"root_cause\", \"related_issues\", \"immediate_actions\", \"long_term_fixes\", \"testing_strategy\", \"owners\", \"timeline_dates\", \"notes\", \"logs\", \"fix_references\", \"open_questions\"]}; gap_analysis=open_bug parameters: agent, title, symptoms, category, affected_paths. Template needs 16 more fields to be complete.; reasoning={\"how\": \"Line-by-line template analysis comparing metadata.get() calls against open_bug metadata dictionary (lines 336-350 in sentinel_tools.py)\", \"what\": \"Template uses Jinja2 with metadata.get() fallbacks for 25+ fields. open_bug metadata only maps 13 fields, rest get placeholder text\", \"why\": \"Need to quantify exactly which template fields are missing from open_bug parameters to propose solution\"}; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/query_enhancement_suite/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-01T23:51:50.811584+00:00_4643f692", "timestamp": "2026-02-01T23:51:50.811627+00:00"}
