{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-02-01 23:51:56 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-QueryTools] [Project: query_enhancement_suite] KEY DISCOVERY: query_entries ALREADY has cross-project agent filtering! Lines 1469-1496 show _search_cross_project iterates projects and passes agents param to _search_single_project (1576-1597), which forwards to _query_file. The agents filter works across projects in search_scope=all_projects mode. Cross-project agent filtering EXISTS and is OPERATIONAL. | confidence=1; file_evidence=[\"query_entries.py:1469-1496\", \"query_entries.py:1568-1599\"]; finding=cross_project_agent_filter_exists; implementation=_search_cross_project loops projects, passes agents to _search_single_project; reasoning={\"how\": \"Traced code flow from search_scope resolution through cross-project iteration to per-project agent filtering\", \"what\": \"Functional cross-project agent filtering via search_scope=all_projects + agents param\", \"why\": \"Critical to document what already exists vs what's missing for enhancement proposal\"}; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/query_enhancement_suite/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-01T23:51:56.739751+00:00_07487d6c", "timestamp": "2026-02-01T23:51:56.739826+00:00"}
