{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-02-01 23:52:09 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-QueryTools] [Project: query_enhancement_suite] STATELESS MODE GAPS IDENTIFIED: (1) read_recent returns error with no useful info when no project set - just \"Invoke set_project\". (2) get_project DOES return last_known_project info (lines 438-450) - includes project name, minutes_ago, last_access_at. This is already helpful! (3) read_recent could adopt same pattern - return available projects list when no project set instead of error. | confidence=0.95; gaps=[\"read_recent error has no context info\", \"get_project has last_known pattern\"]; opportunities=[\"read_recent could return project list\", \"read_recent could show last_known like get_project\"]; reasoning={\"how\": \"Compared get_project's helpful last_known pattern with read_recent's bare error\", \"what\": \"Error response content analysis - what's available vs what's returned\", \"why\": \"Identify enhancement opportunities for stateless operation mode\"}; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/query_enhancement_suite/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-01T23:52:09.933567+00:00_d2ef7c95", "timestamp": "2026-02-01T23:52:09.933638+00:00"}
