{"op": "append", "content": "[\ud83d\udc1e] [2026-02-01 23:59:36 UTC] [Agent: BugHunter-QueryAudit] [Project: query_enhancement_suite] BUG CONFIRMED: query_entries silently adds the calling agent to the agents filter! Line 1079-1086 merges the `agent` parameter (the calling agent) into the `agents` filter list. This means when BugHunter calls query_entries(message=\"Research\"), it searches for entries matching \"Research\" AND agent=\"BugHunter-QueryAudit\". Since ResearchAgent wrote those entries, NO RESULTS RETURNED. This is a severe filter contamination bug! | affected_lines=1079-1086; bug_type=filter_contamination; confidence=0.98; severity=high; stage=diagnosed; priority=high; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/query_enhancement_suite/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-01T23:59:36.546431+00:00_7fa1f727", "timestamp": "2026-02-01T23:59:36.546498+00:00"}
{"op": "commit", "ref_id": "2026-02-01T23:59:36.546431+00:00_7fa1f727", "timestamp": "2026-02-01T23:59:36.559656+00:00"}
{"op": "append", "content": "[\ud83d\udc1e] [2026-02-01 23:59:48 UTC] [Agent: BugHunter-QueryAudit] [Project: query_enhancement_suite] [BUG] query_entries contaminating agents filter with caller identity: query_entries silently returns no results when searching for entries by other agents. Root cause: Lines 1079-1086 merge the `agent` parameter (caller identity) into the `agents` filter list (search criteria). This causes every query to be implicitly filtered to \"only show entries written by the calling agent\", making cross-agent searches impossible. | affected_paths=[\"tools/query_entries.py\"]; case_type=bug; landing_status=proposed; symptoms=query_entries silently returns no results when searching for entries by other agents. Root cause: Lines 1079-1086 merge the `agent` parameter (caller identity) into the `agents` filter list (search criteria). This causes every query to be implicitly filtered to \"only show entries written by the calling agent\", making cross-agent searches impossible.; title=query_entries contaminating agents filter with caller identity; priority=high; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/query_enhancement_suite/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-01T23:59:48.683799+00:00_0237a002", "timestamp": "2026-02-01T23:59:48.683847+00:00"}
