{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-02-02 00:38:52 UTC] [Agent: BugHunter-TemplateRender] [Project: query_enhancement_suite] \u2705 INVESTIGATION COMPLETE - Full diagnostic report:  ROOT CAUSE: template_engine/engine.py line 392 returns raw template string when legacy rendering fails, instead of raising exception.  FAILURE CHAIN: 1. open_bug() calls manage_docs(action='create', metadata={doc_type:'bug'}) 2. manage_docs routes to create_bug_report action handler 3. Calls _render_special_template() with BUG_REPORT_TEMPLATE.md 4. Creates Jinja2TemplateEngine instance and calls render_template() 5. Jinja2 rendering fails with TemplateSyntaxError/TemplateRuntimeError 6. Falls back to _render_legacy_template() at line 436-442 7. Legacy renderer gets raw template source via env.loader.get_source() 8. Attempts to render with str.format_map() (fails for {% extends %} syntax) 9. Exception caught at line 390, silently returns RAW TEMPLATE at line 392 10. manage_docs writes unprocessed template to report.md file  EVIDENCE: - Bug report files are byte-for-byte identical to BUG_REPORT_TEMPLATE.md - Isolated Jinja engine tes... | bug_severity=critical; confidence=1; fix_ready=True; reasoning={\"how\": \"Replace silent return with exception to expose underlying issues\", \"what\": \"Silent failure in legacy fallback hides Jinja rendering errors\", \"why\": \"Complete diagnostic from symptom through code to fix specification\"}; stage=verified; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/query_enhancement_suite/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-02T00:38:52.409886+00:00_d82c5175", "timestamp": "2026-02-02T00:38:52.409934+00:00"}
