{"op": "append", "content": "[\u26a0\ufe0f] [2026-02-02 04:00:07 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-ScribeSearch] [Project: query_enhancement_suite] Analyzing _format_search_readable: Formats ALL matches in results list. If search returned 200 matches (max_total_matches), each with long lines, output could easily hit 794K. No pagination or truncation at format layer. | key_finding=Formatting has no output size limits; lines_analyzed=440-525; reasoning={\"how\": \"Need pagination support OR output size truncation in formatter\", \"what\": \"Formatter iterates ALL matches without size checks or truncation - lines 478-508 print every match with context\", \"why\": \"200 matches with long lines can produce massive output\"}; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/query_enhancement_suite/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-02T04:00:07.039363+00:00_880eb032", "timestamp": "2026-02-02T04:00:07.039406+00:00"}
