{"op": "append", "content": "[\u274c] [2026-02-02 04:00:26 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-QueryEntries] [Project: query_enhancement_suite] ROOT CAUSE IDENTIFIED: Line 20 of utils/logs.py filters out ANY log entry containing the word \"template\" in timestamp, emoji, agent, or message. The _is_template_entry() function treats all entries with \"template\" as example/placeholder entries and silently drops them (returns None from parse_log_line). This explains why searching for \"template\" returns 0 results despite 39 occurrences. | bug_type=logic_error; confidence=1; files_touched=[\"utils/logs.py\"]; lines=[15, 20, 40]; reasoning={\"how\": \"Code inspection of utils/logs.py lines 15-25, traced parse_log_line() line 40 which calls _is_template_entry() and returns None for matches\", \"what\": \"_is_template_entry() uses hardcoded template_indicators list including 'template', causing any entry with that word to be filtered as a placeholder\", \"why\": \"Identified root cause of template search failure - overzealous filtering logic\"}; severity=critical; stage=research; priority=high; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/query_enhancement_suite/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-02T04:00:26.866078+00:00_f5f287f8", "timestamp": "2026-02-02T04:00:26.866143+00:00"}
