{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-02-02 04:00:49 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-ScribeSearch] [Project: query_enhancement_suite] ROOT CAUSE IDENTIFIED: Search limits work correctly (max_total_matches=200 enforced at lines 680-683), but each match includes full line content + context. With 200 matches of ~4KB per match = 800KB total output. No pagination or output size truncation anywhere in pipeline. | confidence=0.95; reasoning={\"how\": \"Limits count MATCHES not OUTPUT SIZE. Need either: (1) pagination, (2) per-line truncation, (3) output size budget\", \"what\": \"Each match stores full line content (can be very long) + context_before + context_after. 200 matches \\u00d7 4KB avg = 800KB\", \"why\": \"794K output despite 200-match limit indicates per-match size explosion\"}; root_cause=match_content_size_not_line_count; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/query_enhancement_suite/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-02T04:00:49.873312+00:00_cd367265", "timestamp": "2026-02-02T04:00:49.873352+00:00"}
