{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-02-02 04:16:29 UTC] [Agent: ArchitectAgent-SearchQueryFix] [Project: query_enhancement_suite] ARCHITECTURE SUMMARY: Designed remediation for two critical bugs - (1) scribe.search output explosion (794K chars, crashes client) and (2) query_entries empty results (template filter false positive). Three-phase solution: Phase 1 fixes template filter logic (require 2+ indicators) + adds 500-char line truncation (1-2h); Phase 2 migrates query_entries to storage backend following read_recent pattern (4-6h); Phase 3 adds pagination to search with page/page_size params (6-8h). All designs verified against code reality. Each phase independently deployable. 13 task packages sized for single Coder sessions. 100 testable checklist items. Architecture documents: SEARCH_QUERY_REMEDIATION_ARCHITECTURE_GUIDE.md, SEARCH_QUERY_REMEDIATION_PHASE_PLAN.md, SEARCH_QUERY_REMEDIATION_CHECKLIST.md. Ready for implementation. | confidence=0.95; issues_addressed=[\"scribe.search output explosion\", \"query_entries template filtering bug\"]; key_decisions=[\"multi-indicator template filter\", \"500-char line truncation\", \"follow read_recent DB pattern\", \"add pagination to search\"]; project=query_enhancement_suite; reasoning={\"how\": \"Code verification with scribe.read_file, followed proven patterns, designed small task packages with explicit boundaries, each phase independently testable and deployable\", \"what\": \"Verified both bugs in code, designed surgical fixes (Phase 1), architectural migration (Phase 2), UX enhancement (Phase 3)\", \"why\": \"Two HIGH severity bugs blocking real usage - need fast deployment path plus architectural cleanup\"}; solution_approach=incremental three-phase deployment; sub_plan=search_query_remediation; summary=True; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/query_enhancement_suite/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-02T04:16:29.847780+00:00_274922cc", "timestamp": "2026-02-02T04:16:29.847835+00:00"}
