{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-02-02 04:55:15 UTC] [Agent: Orchestrator] [Project: query_enhancement_suite] ALL PHASES COMPLETE. Phase 1: Template filter fix + search truncation (41 tests). Phase 2: query_entries DB migration (8 tests). Phase 3: Search pagination with page/page_size (9 tests). Total: 77 tests passing, 0 regressions. Files modified: utils/logs.py, tools/search.py, tools/query_entries.py, plugins/vector_indexer.py, server.py, utils/reminder_validator.py. Ready for commit. | reasoning={\"how\": \"PROTOCOL pipeline: 2 research agents \\u2192 1 architect \\u2192 8 coder agents dispatched across phases\", \"what\": \"13 task packages across 3 phases, all implemented and tested by parallel coder swarms\", \"why\": \"Three critical tool reliability issues resolved: stdout pollution, search output explosion, query_entries empty results\"}; task=implementation_complete; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/query_enhancement_suite/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-02T04:55:15.969347+00:00_539e305f", "timestamp": "2026-02-02T04:55:15.969411+00:00"}
